            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098960/extras/2301e7b09575cc83d327749609feb2de.poster.avif?t=1792327830\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098960/extras/2301e7b09575cc83d327749609feb2de.webm?t=1792327830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098960/extras/2301e7b09575cc83d327749609feb2de.mp4?t=1792327830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Home Paige</strong> is a momentum-based 3D platformer set inside an Operating System. You play as Paige, a silly, optimistic girl from your computer! ⭐ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paige has lived in <strong>The RECYCLING BIN</strong> her whole life; a worthless place where useless people go to get deleted. She’s learned not to get attached, because why would you if everyone disappears? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paige must sprint, swing and slide through a digital world filled with fast-paced platforming challenges, explore surreal spaces and befriend an odd cast of characters as she uncovers a much bigger story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098960/extras/2dd0d879aefcbc07d63a5d5312fdcb14.poster.avif?t=1792327830\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098960/extras/2dd0d879aefcbc07d63a5d5312fdcb14.webm?t=1792327830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098960/extras/2dd0d879aefcbc07d63a5d5312fdcb14.mp4?t=1792327830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highly Animated Storytelling</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paige has learned not to get attached to others, until the frantic mouse-like Oliver comes tumbling into her life, making her question if escaping the Recycling Bin is possible for the first time. The character-rich story unfolds through expressive, fully voiced 3D character animation bursting with personality featuring <strong>Nola Klop</strong> as Paige and <strong>Michael Kovach</strong> as Oliver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098960/extras/80687ddc29738bc69906ebc38ffe01e5.poster.avif?t=1792327830\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098960/extras/80687ddc29738bc69906ebc38ffe01e5.webm?t=1792327830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098960/extras/80687ddc29738bc69906ebc38ffe01e5.mp4?t=1792327830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Momentum-Driven Platforming</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paige is light on her feet and built for high-speed movement! Jump through vibrant stages, building up speed to tackle challenges built around Paige’s expressive moveset. Swing through courses from a computer cursor, dash-punch through enemies and take on intimidating bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098960/extras/28159e062a02e653ffe8186e7c6590d2.poster.avif?t=1792327830\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098960/extras/28159e062a02e653ffe8186e7c6590d2.webm?t=1792327830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098960/extras/28159e062a02e653ffe8186e7c6590d2.mp4?t=1792327830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Strange Operating System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dreamy digital world sprawling with surreal spaces and liminal vistas. Offbeat neighborhoods invite Paige to socialize with strangers, shop around, try strange foods and play minigames in a world inspired by a lost era of the internet, with puzzles to solve and secrets waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098960/extras/90bb0f89666b608b748a009390a302c5.poster.avif?t=1792327830\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098960/extras/90bb0f89666b608b748a009390a302c5.webm?t=1792327830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098960/extras/90bb0f89666b608b748a009390a302c5.mp4?t=1792327830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet an Eccentric Cast</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Operating System is full of life, filled with a variety of digital misfits. From moody shopkeeper Sophy to bombastic host Sunny Bigtime, Paige will meet a curious collection of characters, buddy up with unlikely friends and stumble into inhabitants that aren't always what they seem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complete singleplayer Chapter packed with platforming challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large environments to explore, puzzles to solve &amp; bosses to overcome</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expressive, fully voiced 3D character animation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional challenge stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minigames with high-scores to chase</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable main menu. Make the Operating System your own!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guest collaborations and crossovers with Snaptic, FifLeo, TheGrandestGoon, and others..!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PC, Mac &amp; Linux support</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Demo only supports PC for now!)</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Text support in English, Japanese, Russian, Latin American Spanish, Brazilian Portuguese.<br></p></li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098960/extras/2301e7b09575cc83d327749609feb2de.poster.avif?t=1792327830\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098960/extras/2301e7b09575cc83d327749609feb2de.webm?t=1792327830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098960/extras/2301e7b09575cc83d327749609feb2de.mp4?t=1792327830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Home Paige</strong> is a momentum-based 3D platformer set inside an Operating System. You play as Paige, a silly, optimistic girl from your computer! ⭐ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paige has lived in <strong>The RECYCLING BIN</strong> her whole life; a worthless place where useless people go to get deleted. She’s learned not to get attached, because why would you if everyone disappears? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paige must sprint, swing and slide through a digital world filled with fast-paced platforming challenges, explore surreal spaces and befriend an odd cast of characters as she uncovers a much bigger story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098960/extras/2dd0d879aefcbc07d63a5d5312fdcb14.poster.avif?t=1792327830\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098960/extras/2dd0d879aefcbc07d63a5d5312fdcb14.webm?t=1792327830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098960/extras/2dd0d879aefcbc07d63a5d5312fdcb14.mp4?t=1792327830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highly Animated Storytelling</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paige has learned not to get attached to others, until the frantic mouse-like Oliver comes tumbling into her life, making her question if escaping the Recycling Bin is possible for the first time. The character-rich story unfolds through expressive, fully voiced 3D character animation bursting with personality featuring <strong>Nola Klop</strong> as Paige and <strong>Michael Kovach</strong> as Oliver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098960/extras/80687ddc29738bc69906ebc38ffe01e5.poster.avif?t=1792327830\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098960/extras/80687ddc29738bc69906ebc38ffe01e5.webm?t=1792327830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098960/extras/80687ddc29738bc69906ebc38ffe01e5.mp4?t=1792327830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Momentum-Driven Platforming</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paige is light on her feet and built for high-speed movement! Jump through vibrant stages, building up speed to tackle challenges built around Paige’s expressive moveset. Swing through courses from a computer cursor, dash-punch through enemies and take on intimidating bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098960/extras/28159e062a02e653ffe8186e7c6590d2.poster.avif?t=1792327830\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098960/extras/28159e062a02e653ffe8186e7c6590d2.webm?t=1792327830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098960/extras/28159e062a02e653ffe8186e7c6590d2.mp4?t=1792327830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Strange Operating System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dreamy digital world sprawling with surreal spaces and liminal vistas. Offbeat neighborhoods invite Paige to socialize with strangers, shop around, try strange foods and play minigames in a world inspired by a lost era of the internet, with puzzles to solve and secrets waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098960/extras/90bb0f89666b608b748a009390a302c5.poster.avif?t=1792327830\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098960/extras/90bb0f89666b608b748a009390a302c5.webm?t=1792327830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098960/extras/90bb0f89666b608b748a009390a302c5.mp4?t=1792327830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet an Eccentric Cast</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Operating System is full of life, filled with a variety of digital misfits. From moody shopkeeper Sophy to bombastic host Sunny Bigtime, Paige will meet a curious collection of characters, buddy up with unlikely friends and stumble into inhabitants that aren't always what they seem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complete singleplayer Chapter packed with platforming challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large environments to explore, puzzles to solve &amp; bosses to overcome</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expressive, fully voiced 3D character animation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional challenge stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minigames with high-scores to chase</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable main menu. Make the Operating System your own!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guest collaborations and crossovers with Snaptic, FifLeo, TheGrandestGoon, and others..!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PC, Mac &amp; Linux support</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Demo only supports PC for now!)</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Text support in English, Japanese, Russian, Latin American Spanish, Brazilian Portuguese.<br></p></li></ul>",
